type: software
title: "PharmaCalc-Bench"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of computational pharmacology problems. Each task pairs a
  self-contained problem with a Python reference solution that computes the
  ground truth, an AI model answer, and a written expert critique of that
  answer.
